P18,Advanced Science - 2017 - Mahmood - Electrocatalysts for Hydrogen Evolution in Alkaline Electrolytes  Mechanisms ,Advanced Science - 2017 - Mahmood - Electrocatalysts for Hydrogen Evolution in Alkaline Electrolytes  Mechanisms .pdf,11,11,P18_p11_084,"(iv) Heteroatom Doping: Doping with metal or nonmetal elements is one of the most effective ways to improve electrocatalytic activity. So far, lots of binary or ternary alloys and nonmetal doped electrocatalysts have been tailored with high performances. [5,51,76,92-95] Ni-based binary compounds with different dopants as Ni3S2, Ni3N, or Ni5P4 show that heteroatoms such as P, S, and N actively take part in the reaction instead as simple spectator."
